               <rdf:li>UG10184</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>NXP Bluetooth Low Energy Host Stack</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>Application Programming Interface (API)</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>BLE host stack APIs</rdf:li>
